  # Transform Your Team into a High-Performing Agile: A Step-by-Step Guide to Addressing Anti-Patterns
  
  [![Mona Shari](https://miro.medium.com/v2/da:true/resize:fill:32:32/0*nYJd9K6m1e4igjTz)](https://medium.com/@shari.mona?source=post_page---byline--27eabb36a627---------------------------------------)
  
